{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2021-10-26 06:30:00', 'title': 'PULTEGROUP REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PULTEGROUP, INC. (NYSE: PHM) ANNOUNCED TODAY FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY REPORTED NET INCOME OF $476 MILLION, OR $1.82 PER SHARE. IN THE PRIOR YEAR, THE COMPANY REPORTED NET INCOME OF $416 MILLION, OR $1.54 PER SHARE, AND ADJUSTED NET INCOME OF $363 MILLION, OR $1.34 PER SHARE, WHICH EXCLUDES A TAX BENEFIT OF $53 MILLION RESULTING FROM ENERGY TAX CREDITS RECORDED IN THE PERIOD. “PULTEGROUP'S THIRD QUART"}